<div class="nm-two-col">
<h2>What I've built.</h2>
<div class="nm-ledger">
<a href="work-posta.html"><span class="nm-page-label">Posta · Co-founder</span><strong>A podcast company before podcasting became obvious</strong><p>Posta began in Buenos Aires in 2014 and built original programming, branded audio, audience relationships, distribution, and regional operations. I worked across product, marketing, growth, positioning, and business development. PodX acquired a majority stake in 2022.</p></a>
<a href="work-roxom.html"><span class="nm-page-label">Roxom TV · Founding team</span><strong>A 24/7 global media operation</strong><p>I worked across media architecture and product operations as Roxom TV built live, editorial, data, automation, and internal-tooling systems spanning San Francisco, London, Hong Kong, and remote work from Buenos Aires.</p></a>
<div class="nm-ledger-item"><span class="nm-page-label">Teaching and programs</span><strong>Digital House · ICFJ / SembraMedia Velocidad</strong><p>I taught Digital Marketing at Digital House (2017–2022) and was Academic Content Lead for the initial and advanced courses in Argentina and Brazil (2018–2022), including immersion and in-company programs. Posta took part in the Velocidad accelerator, run by ICFJ and SembraMedia.</p></div>
<div class="nm-contact-actions"><p>Read more about my role in the <a href="work-posta.html">Posta</a> and <a href="work-roxom.html">Roxom TV</a> case studies, which include links to public coverage.</p></div>
</div>
