<h2>Products I'm working on.</h2>
<div>
<p class="nm-page-copy">You can try the products or open their public repositories.</p>
<div class="nm-ledger nm-project-grid"> <a href="https://priceb.tc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Live data · Broadcast graphics</span><strong>PRICEB.TC <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Creates free live Bitcoin price widgets for websites and transparent OBS overlays in more than 160 fiat currencies.</p></a> <a href="https://github.com/diegodella1/f1-race-monitor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Sim racing · Live telemetry</span><strong>F1 Race Monitor <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>A local-first race engineer for EA SPORTS F1 25, with live timing, strategy, race radio, and car health on a phone or tablet beside the wheel.</p></a> <a href="https://f1.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Formula 1 · Race strategy</span><strong>F1 Companion <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Turns Formula 1 race-weekend timing into context on battles, pace, tyres, and strategy.</p></a> <a href="https://signal.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Independent radio · Visual culture</span><strong>SIGNAL <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Combines independent music, visual culture, and brief updates in a browser-based radio experience.</p></a> <a class="nm-project-featured" href="https://xposter.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">AI-native media · Editorial operations</span><strong>XPoster <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Monitors authorized sources, detects relevant events, and prepares evidence-linked drafts while editors retain final control.</p></a> <a href="https://referi.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Interactive media product</span><strong>Referí <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>A pocket referee booth for live matches: review the play, make the call, and compare it with the official ruling.</p></a> <a href="https://liveoverlay.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Live media · Audience interaction</span><strong>LiveOverlay <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Controls QR codes, polls, tickers, lower thirds, sponsors, and more from a single OBS Browser Source.</p></a> <a href="https://renamer.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Content workflow · Local automation</span><strong>Renamer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Turns vague filenames into descriptive, safe, and reversible names for photos, screenshots, and PDFs, processed locally.</p></a> <a href="https://lifearg.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Relocation intelligence</span><strong>Life Match Argentina <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Matches the life you want with Argentine cities using comparable evidence, transparent trade-offs, and confidence levels.</p></a> <a href="https://digsign.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Content operations</span><strong>DigSign <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Centralizes campaigns, approvals, playlists, screens, and playback monitoring for brands, franchises, and agencies.</p></a> <a href="https://intelligenz.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">AI agent · Editorial research</span><strong>Intelligenz <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Turns monitored sources into daily briefs ranked against each leader's goals, risks, actors, and opportunities.</p></a> <a href="https://audience.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Audience research · Product strategy</span><strong>DecisionOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Uses synthetic focus groups to surface objections and turn a product proposal into next experiments before building or launching.</p></a> <a href="https://broadcast-planner.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Editorial operations · Media automation</span><strong>Broadcast Control Room <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>Plans the broadcast day, prepares media, catches schedule risk, and sends protected browser playout into OBS or vMix.</p></a> <a href="https://teleprompter.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Live production · Content workflow</span><strong>telePRO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>A browser-based teleprompter for live production, remote control, rehearsal, and reliable on-camera delivery.</p></a> <a href="https://tradingbot.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Trading systems</span><strong>PolyBot BTC <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>A safety-first research and paper-trading framework for recurring BTC Up/Down prediction markets.</p></a> <a href="https://presidente.diegodella.ar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="nm-page-label">Political simulation</span><strong>El Presidente <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><p>A daily game of decisions, consequences, and minigames: govern for four years and discover what kind of president you were.</p></a> </div>
